{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51732","headline":"宋使君罢新定移出东馆（二首） 一 · 贯休","name":"宋使君罢新定移出东馆（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无爲政化更何爲，到即生人妪煦肥。\n必似汉高三杰去，且将刘宠一钱归。\n玉阶香惹麒麟步，银汉风驱鸑鷟飞。\n爲报蒸民莫惆怅，陶钧及尔更光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}